  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><strong>Brand introduction</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span>Commissioned Art is an innovative service that offers personalized art commissions, allowing customers to transform images of themselves, friends, family, or idols into unique art pieces. This service extends to creating art in the styles of customers' favorite artists, bridging personal preferences with artistic expression. </span><br><br><strong>Unique Selling Point</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span>Commissioned Art's unique selling point lies in its combination of personalization, artistic freedom, and high-quality production. We empowers customers to create custom art that reflects personal memories, fantasies, or inspirations, rendered in the styles of renowned artists or chosen themes. This service democratizes art creation, making \"everyone an artist\" by removing traditional barriers to art commissioning and offering a platform where imagination is the only limit.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><strong>Product description</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span>The products are available as printed artwork on high-quality canvas or premium paper, with options like an oak frame for display, or as high definition digital copies.</span><br><br>&nbsp;<br>Payment terms</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Monthly bank transfer.</p>",
